    <string name="about_body">OBAA Home 2.0\n\nA calm, glass-first launcher for Fire TV.\nCurated apps, a large-minutes clock and a swipeable movie deck — all drawn locally, with no bloatware.</string>
    <string name="default_home_hint">Fire TV 5.1 pins its own Home button. Enable OBAA\'s Home key service in Fire TV Settings &gt; Accessibility, or use the ADB commands in the README. The stock launcher stays installed and can be restored by disabling the service.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_label">OBAA Home key</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Lets OBAA Home open when you press the Fire TV Home button.</string>
    <string name="licenses_body">OBAA Home is built with the Android SDK and standard Android widgets.\n\nWeather data: Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com).\nLocation lookup: ip-api.com.\n\nAll artwork is drawn procedurally on-device.</string>
